# edgelab second instance — Pepperstone cTrader DEMO, EUR+BTC (~$5k), on the SHARED main app + token.
# Copy to .env in ~/edgelab-eurbtc, fill the blanks, then: chmod 600 .env
#
# DESIGN (why there's no second app or second token here):
# Spotware rejects a second Open API app per user — one approved app supports multiple simultaneous
# connections. So this bot REUSES the main FP Markets bot's `edgelab-bot` app AND its token. It runs with
# --no-refresh (read-only): it reads the access token the main bot keeps fresh and NEVER refreshes. Only
# the main bot refreshes, so the two processes can't rotate each other's token (the 11-15 / 11-21 flap).
#
# --- Same app as the main (FP Markets) bot --------------------------------------------------------
# Copy these two straight from the main bot:   grep -E '^CTRADER_CLIENT_(ID|SECRET)=' ~/edgelab/.env
CTRADER_CLIENT_ID=
CTRADER_CLIENT_SECRET=
#
# --- This bot's account (Pepperstone demo) --------------------------------------------------------
# The Pepperstone DEMO account's ctidTraderAccountId — NOT the login 5378281 you see in the portal.
# Discover it (read-only, safe beside the live bot):
#   cd ~/edgelab-eurbtc && CTRADER_TOKEN_STORE=/home/ubuntu/edgelab/.ctrader_refresh_token \
#       .venv/bin/python examples/list_accounts.py
# then use the ctidTraderAccountId of the row with isLive=False and the Pepperstone login (5378281).
CTRADER_ACCOUNT_ID=
#
# --- Shared token (read-only) ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Point at the MAIN bot's token store (absolute path). This bot reads <path>.access and never writes it.
# No CTRADER_ACCESS_TOKEN / CTRADER_REFRESH_TOKEN here — the main bot owns them; --no-refresh reads .access.
CTRADER_TOKEN_STORE=/home/ubuntu/edgelab/.ctrader_refresh_token
#
# --- Telegram -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Reuse the main bot's bot token + chat id; EDGELAB_LABEL tags this bot's messages in the shared chat.
# (Or make a second BotFather bot and put ITS token here instead, and drop EDGELAB_LABEL.)
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=
EDGELAB_LABEL=[pepper-eurbtc]
